# 统一换行符：仓库里统一存 LF，各系统检出时自动转换
# 不加这个文件，Windows 上会一直报 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告
* text=auto

# 这些是二进制文件，不要做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary

# 锁文件不要参与 diff 统计
package-lock.json -diff
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff
